	// AdditionalSoftTimeoutMessages Extra static filler messages for subsequent soft timeouts in the same LLM generation. The first timeout uses `message`. If fewer messages are configured than `max_soft_timeouts_per_generation`, the last configured message is repeated; otherwise a built-in filler is used.
